<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RailTex started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RailTex started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of RailTex Inc with intermediate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- analyst Mike Lloyd set a $22-$23 12-month price target on the stock, which closed Friday at 16-7/8.</p>
<p>-- set earnings per share estimates of $1.12 for 1997 and $1.40 for 1998.</p>
</text>
